 ### Managed servers
 
+The downstream Devin adapter runs its host-derived core, cron, Bot dashboard
+and panel entries through `acp/harness/devin_mcp.py`. Each redeems its own
+process-bound IPC pickup before serving the ordinary tools, preserving the
+credential mask. This adapter route does not change third-party commands or
+other backends; see [Devin onboarding](../system-specs/modules/harness-onboarding.md#devin-experimental-backend).
+
+
 `agent._MANAGED_MCP_SERVERS` holds the ten servers the gateway owns end to
 end: the always-on `kirocrew-cron`, `kirocrew-core`, `kirocrew-guide` and
 `kirocrew-mate`, the gated `kirocrew-computer`, and the opt-in
