+read-only gate artifacts. A nonce-bound standard permission envelope carries the
+complete native call into the existing HookManager/governance/audit path. Native
+persistent/bypass choices cannot grant trust; failed IPC blocks and an unasked or
+denied completion fails the bridge closed. Its native config is isolated, native
+project hook/config sources refuse this harness, and Crew's OS sandbox and vendor
+credential mask remain in force. Only Devin's own declared credential leaf is
+spared. The measured version and limits are recorded in
+[harness-onboarding](harness-onboarding.md#devin-experimental-backend).
